for carrying out the functions of the EKU Police Department. These functions include protection of life and property, preservation of the peace and good order of the University community, and the furnishing of various services to enhance and support the operations of the University. Read more Interpreter 497395 Richmond Campus Student Support Positions Part-Time Staff An Interpreter facilitates communication between current students who are deaf/hard of hearing in all academic aspects of the university experience. Including but not limited to, classroom lectures, academic advising, field trips, and internships. Read more Online Course Facilitator - Fire and Safety Engineering Technology 497373 Remote Opportunities College of Justice, Safety & Military Science Part-Time Faculty The University is accepting applications for part-time Online Course Facilitators within the Fire and Safety Engineering Technology program for online programs on an ongoing and as-needed basis. Read more Part-Time Faculty, Fire and Safety Engineering Technology 497372 Richmond Campus College of Justice, Safety & Military Science Part-Time Faculty The Fire and Safety Engineering Technology program is hiring part-time faculty to be the instructor of record for courses. These courses could be in any of the following degrees: Fire Protection Administration, Fire Protection and Safety Engineering Technology, and/or Fire, Arson, and Explosion, Investigation. Read more Journeyman HVAC-R Technician 496528 Richmond Campus Maintenance Positions Skilled Craft Positions Fulltime Staff A Journeyman HVAC-R Technician installs, maintains, and repairs all HVAC and Refrigeration equipment in accordance with established procedures. Read more Journeyman Electrician 495139 Richmond Campus Skilled Craft Positions Fulltime Staff Works directly with the Electric Shop Supervisor on a daily basis and with the MEP Manager as need arises, to assure that all University electrical systems operate at the highest efficiency. Read more Outside Service Attendant - Arlington 497348 Other EKU Location Arlington Part-Time Staff As a golf cart attendant at a country club, your main responsibility is to assist club members and guests with their golfing needs. Read more Community Education Facilitator 497329 Richmond Campus Skilled Craft Positions Part-Time Staff A Community Education Facilitator is responsible for instruction, monitoring, and/or preparing curriculum for community classes. Read more Online Course Facilitator - School of Justice Studies 497313 Remote Opportunities College of Justice, Safety & Military Science Part-Time Faculty Instructor of Record or Facilitator for online Criminal Justice, Police Studies, or Corrections courses. Read more Assistant Professor, Construction Management 497290 Richmond Campus College of Justice, Safety & Military Science Fulltime Faculty The Construction Management Program in the School of Safety, Security, & Emergency Management at Eastern Kentucky University seeks applicants for a tenure track position in Construction Management at the rank of Assistant Professor for Academic Year 2026-2027. The position begins August 2026. Read more Part-Time Faculty - Emergency Medical Care 497255 Remote Opportunities College of Justice, Safety & Military Science Part-Time Faculty The Department of Justice, Safety, & Military Science at Eastern Kentucky University invites applications for a part-time faculty position to teach courses in Emergency Medical Care. Read more Online Course Facilitator 497307 Remote Opportunities College of Business Part-Time Faculty The University is accepting applications for part-time Online Course Facilitators within the MBA program for online programs on an ongoing, as-needed basis. Read more Part Time Faculty- School of Justice Studies 497303 Richmond Campus College of Justice, Safety & Military Science Part-Time Faculty The School of Justice Studies at Eastern Kentucky University invites applications for a part-time faculty position to teach courses in Criminal Justice/Police Studies/Corrections. Read more Online Facilitator - Construction Management 497289 Remote Opportunities College of Justice, Safety & Military Science Part-Time Faculty The University is accepting applications for part-time Online Course Facilitators within the Bachelor of Science in Construction Management online courses on an ongoing and as-needed basis. Online classes will include statics and structural analysis. Facilitators should have an engineering background. When an opening is available, applications will be considered in the applicant pool. Read more Online Course Facilitator - Dep't of Government 497284 Remote Opportunities College of Letters, Arts & Soc Sciences Part-Time Faculty The Eastern Kentucky University Department of Government is accepting applications for an adjunct faculty position/online course facilitator in Political Science. Successful candidates will teach/facilitate courses in American Government, International Politics and other Political Science subfields . These courses will be taught entirely online using the Canvas learning management system. A Masters Degree or higher is required for this position. Previous undergraduate teaching experience, especially in online learning settings, is preferred.\n \nThe University places a high priority on being leaders in the responsible use of artificial intelligence and in building such capacity in our students.  The successful candidate will demonstrate knowledge of artificial intelligence pertinent to the discipline and/or a willingness to pursue professional development to acquire such expertise. Read more Senior Analyst, Programmer, Enterprise Applications 497236 Richmond Campus Technology Positions Fulltime Staff The Senior Programmer Analyst, Enterprise Applications provides development and support for the university's ERP, web, and digital properties, ensuring a seamless and engaging user experience. This role is responsible for developing, maintaining, and optimizing ERP applications, web applications, integrating systems, and implementing solutions that enhance usability, accessibility, and functionality. The Senior Programmer Analyst, Enterprise Applications collaborates with multiple departments to ensure ERP and websites align with university branding, security, and technology standards Read more Lecturer 497209 Richmond Campus College of Business Fulltime Faculty The Berman Center for Professional Sales at Eastern Kentucky University invites applications for a dynamic, innovative Lecturer to lead our University Sales Team and teach engaging undergraduate and graduate courses in sales and marketing. The position begins August 2026. Read more Assistant Professor, Aviation 497102 Richmond Campus College of Justice, Safety & Military Science Fulltime Faculty The EKU School of Aviation invites applications for a tenure-track Assistant/Associate Professor to begin January 6, 2026. Read more Associate Controller 497084 Richmond Campus Financial Positions Fulltime Staff To assist the Controller’s office with all facets of financial compliance and reporting. Read more Architect 494369 Richmond Campus Skilled Craft Positions Fulltime Staff This position is in the Division of Facilities Management & Safety. The architect administrates capital construction projects across the main campus and at regional campuses. The Capital Construction Project Administrator will be responsible for ensuring that the needs of user groups are clearly communicated to design professionals and that projects are designed to efficiently and effectively implement desired programs. That construction is accomplished timely and within budget. The position will oversee the administration of projects from initial planning, programming, and budgeting through the warranty period. Read more Displaying 151 - 170 of 170 in total ‹ 1 2 3 4 5 6 › Equal Opportunity Eastern Kentucky University is an Equal Opportunity employer and educational 